  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4904.06 Request for Inactive Status of Certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4904.06 Request for Inactive Status of Certificate.\n\n(a) The department shall place a certificate holder on inactive status upon written request. All requests shall be sent to the address set forth in Saf-C 4904.04 above.\n\n(b) The certificate holder shall remain on inactive status until such time as reactivation is requested, pursuant to these rules.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4900.html"
